1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,443
The running app workflow hasn't changed for the last twenty years.

2
00:00:03,443 --> 00:00:05,085
Today, we're changing that.

3
00:00:05,085 --> 00:00:07,009
Introducing RUNNR.

4
00:00:07,009 --> 00:00:10,723
Your personal AI running coach — built for real life.

5
00:00:10,723 --> 00:00:12,316
Let me show you how it works.

6
00:00:12,316 --> 00:00:14,571
You start by telling your coach what's going on.

7
00:00:14,571 --> 00:00:17,622
For example, "my knee's a bit sore from yesterday."

8
00:00:17,622 --> 00:00:22,071
Or, "I have a 10K in eight weeks and can only run three days."

9
00:00:22,071 --> 00:00:25,833
Or, "traveling this weekend — hotel gym only."

10
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:31,384
The RUNNR coach goes to work, adapts your plan, and tells you exactly what to do next.

11
00:00:31,384 --> 00:00:32,879
No metrics to track.

12
00:00:32,879 --> 00:00:34,558
No data to analyze.

13
00:00:34,558 --> 00:00:35,441
Just run.

14
00:00:35,441 --> 00:00:37,365
And those were just three moments.

15
00:00:37,365 --> 00:00:40,857
Imagine what a coach that flexes around your life could unlock.

16
00:00:40,857 --> 00:00:42,340
This is just version one.

17
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,627
It's just the beginning.

18
00:00:43,627 --> 00:00:48,345
We're opening early access to runners who want a coach — not another spreadsheet.

19
00:00:48,345 --> 00:00:50,955
Get notified at runnrapp.com today.

